        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "39 Thomas Moore Road, Walkinstown, Dublin 12\r\n\r\nDavid Ross Estate Agents, your local property experts, are delighted to present new to the market no.39 Thomas Moore Road. Located in the heart of Walkinstown, this beautiful 3 bed property is destined to catch the eye of any discerning purchaser.\r\n\r\nNumber 39 is surrounded by a host of local amenities with many shops, cafes and restaurants as well as great sports facilities and parks right on your doorstep. You are also within close proximity to areas such as Terenure, Drimnagh and Crumlin.\r\n\r\nWalking through the front door you are immediately met with a warm and welcoming entrance hallway. Just off this you have a cosy front reception room. Moving through the property you enter a fine and spacious living area which brings both a classic feel and has plenty of natural light coming in through the back doors. The ground floor also comprises a bright and airy kitchen/dining area. The entire layout of this floor would have plenty of potential to be a fantastic entertaining space.\r\n\r\nTo the rear you have a private and sunny back garden, complete with a block built shed to the very rear.\r\n\r\nUpstairs briefly comprises three bedrooms, a double to the rear with bespoke fitted wardrobes and a double alongside a single bedroom to the front aspect. A fully tiled family bathroom completes the first floor.\r\n\r\nThis property benefits from fantastic public transport links with several bus routes running throughout the area. The M50 and N7 motorways are also only a short drive away which makes access to the Greater Dublin Area and beyond as easy as it can be.\r\n\r\nThis property will be very popular so early viewing would be recommended.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Extended\r\n- End terrace\r\n- Highly sought after location\r\n- Great condition\r\n- Private back garden"
      },
